# Stack: Expo / React Native in `{{ path }}/`

- Expo SDK with Expo Router (file-based routes in `{{ path }}/app/`). TypeScript strict.
- Package manager: pnpm with `node-linker=hoisted` (see `.npmrc`). Add native
  modules with `npx expo install <pkg>` so versions match the SDK.
- Don't edit `ios/` or `android/`. They're generated by `npx expo prebuild`
  and ignored. Change native config through `app.config.ts` and config plugins.
- Lint and format: Biome (the hook runs it on every edit). Tests: jest-expo and
  React Native Testing Library, colocated as `*.test.tsx`.
- Check: `scripts/check.sh expo`. Run the app: `npx expo start`.
{%- if use_eas %}
- Builds and store submissions: EAS (`eas.json`). PRs publish an EAS Update
  preview. Release builds run with `eas build --profile production`.
{%- endif %}
- Bundle ID: `{{ bundle_id }}`.
